hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2967","###\n Narrated to us Ahmad bin Sa'id Ad-Darimi, who narrated to us Ali bin Al-Hasan bin Shaqiq, who narrated to us Abu Hamza, from Ata' bin As-Sa'ib, from Sa'id bin Jubayr, from Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: \Jibril (AS) came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and took him to show him the rites (of Hajj). The mountain Thabir opened up for him"," and he entered Mina. He was shown the J"""
